{
  "_comment": "Golden Collections, the importable Nuvio collections pack. Each collection is a row of folders on the Nuvio home screen; each folder opens Movies and Shows tabs served by this addon, so no other addon and no user API key is needed. Folder source fields: provider (streaming service key from providers.json, region-aware), network (TMDB network id, shows), company (TMDB company ids, pipe = OR), collection (TMDB franchise collection id), parts (a universe: {collections: [ids], movies: [ids]}, in release order), person (TMDB person id, the films they directed, from their credits), language (original language code), list (public MDBList JSON URL, per type), genre (TMDB genre id per type), keyword (TMDB keyword ids, pipe = OR), discover (explicit TMDB discover params per type), trending. Optional: params (extra TMDB params), types (restrict to movie/series), regions (only show in these regions), indiaMix ([global, india] weights, or false to disable blending), tileShape. Genre, keyword, mood and curated folders blend Indian movies and series into every page (weights in providers.json indiaMix). All ids verified against TMDB on 2026-10-31.",
  "version": 2,
  "regionOrder": {
    "IN": ["spotlight", "streaming", "indian-cinema", "originals", "genres", "indian-studios", "franchises", "indian-franchises", "universes", "directors", "anime", "studios", "moods", "curated", "world-cinema", "decades", "runtime"],
    "_default": ["spotlight", "streaming", "originals", "genres", "franchises", "universes", "studios", "directors", "anime", "indian-cinema", "indian-franchises", "moods", "curated", "world-cinema", "indian-studios", "decades", "runtime"]
  },
